{"unit_id":"xiaoxianyu-office__dsh-skills-manager#readme-8","repo":"xiaoxianyu-office/dsh-skills-manager","commit":"3b93ba2a58b74a3ad48041f28ae7b1e165ac3f6c","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skills-manager README · 说明：- host 端依赖宿主服务：`skills` / `fs` / `shell` / `sandboxPolicy` / `webServer`\n- 写操作使用 `danger-full-access` 策略以管理 `~/.dsh/skills`，写后等待 300ms 让文件 watcher 完成注册表更新\n- `/skmg` API 仅接受本机回环请求（源地址 + Host 头双重校验），不要将该端口暴露到局域网/公网\n- client bundle 为手写 `__ModuleLoader__` 成品，无 prepare 脚本，不受 pnpm `allowBuilds` 限制","source":"extracted","section":"说明"}
